{"seq":1,"slug":"http-keepalive-agent","title":"HTTP Agent、keepalive 与连接复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-performance-optimization/services-memory/http-keepalive-agent","wordCount":2218,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"http-agent-keepalive-与连接复用\">HTTP Agent、keepalive 与连接复用</h1><p>一个服务在每个请求里调用两次下游 API，P50 延迟 60 毫秒。把它拆开看，其中 45 毫秒是在建立连接——TCP 三次握手加 TLS 协商。这意味着真正的业务处理只用了 15 毫秒，剩下 70% 的时间花在了重复做同一件本可以只做一次的事上。连接复用是 Node.js 性能优化里投入产出比最高的一项，因为改动通常只有几行配置，而收益是系统性的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HTTP 连接的生命周期包含三个可缓存的部分：TCP 连接、TLS 会话、HTTP 连接上的并发槽位。keepalive 复用的是第一与第二项——它让同一个 socket 服务多个请求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[发起请求] --&gt; B{连接池有可用 socket}&#10;    B --&gt;|有| C[直接写入请求]&#10;    B --&gt;|没有且未达上限| D[建立 TCP + TLS]&#10;    B --&gt;|已达 maxSockets| E[进入排队队列]&#10;    D --&gt; F[写入请求]&#10;    C --&gt; G[读取响应]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{响应含 Connection close}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[关闭并释放]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[归还池中 maxFreeSockets]&#10;    J --&gt;|用户空闲| K[timeout 后销毁]&#10;    E --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[发起请求] --&gt; B{连接池有可用 socket}\n    B --&gt;|有| C[直接写入请求]\n    B --&gt;|没有且未达上限| D[建立 TCP + TLS]\n    B --&gt;|已达 maxSockets| E[进入排队队列]\n    D --&gt; F[写入请求]\n    C --&gt; G[读取响应]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{响应含 Connection close}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[关闭并释放]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[归还池中 maxFreeSockets]\n    J --&gt;|用户空闲| K[timeout 后销毁]\n    E --&gt; B</pre><p>两个必须区分的历史事实。<strong>Node.js 19 之前</strong>，<code>http.globalAgent</code> 的 <code>keepAlive</code> 默认为 <code>false</code>——每个出站请求都新建连接，用完即关。<strong>Node.js 19 起</strong>（包括 v22 Jod、v24 Krypton、v26）默认改为 <code>true</code>，并默认 <code>keepAliveMsecs: 1000</code>。这意味着在 v24 LTS 上运行的新代码已经享受到了默认的连接复用，但如果代码里显式传了 <code>agent: false</code> 或者自己 <code>new http.Agent()</code> 覆盖默认值，就会退回旧行为。</p>\n<p><code>agent: false</code> 是一个常见但代价高昂的写法。它让每个请求创建一次性的 agent，效果等同于禁用 keepalive。历史上的用法是&quot;避免 agent 内部的 socket 泄漏&quot;，但在现代版本里这个理由已经不存在。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置写法</th>\n<th>连接复用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不传 <code>agent</code></td>\n<td>复用（Node 19+）</td>\n<td>默认，绝大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>agent: false</code></td>\n<td>不复用</td>\n<td>只在明确需要隔离连接时（如不同证书）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>new http.Agent({ keepAlive: true })</code></td>\n<td>复用</td>\n<td>需要调 <code>maxSockets</code> 等参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>undici.Agent</code> / <code>undici.Pool</code></td>\n<td>复用</td>\n<td>使用 <code>fetch</code> 时的底座</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键参数与取值依据\">关键参数与取值依据</h2><p>连接池的行为由五个参数决定，其中三个直接影响性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import http from &#39;node:http&#39;;&#10;import https from &#39;node:https&#39;;&#10;import { Agent } from &#39;undici&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const httpAgent = new http.Agent({&#10;  keepAlive: true,&#10;  keepAliveMsecs: 1000,&#10;  maxSockets: 128,&#10;  maxFreeSockets: 32,&#10;  scheduling: &#39;lifo&#39;,&#10;  timeout: 30_000,&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const downstream = new Agent({&#10;  keepAliveTimeout: 10_000,&#10;  keepAliveMaxTimeout: 60_000,&#10;  connections: 128,&#10;  pipelining: 1,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import http from 'node:http';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import https from 'node:https';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { Agent } from 'undici';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const httpAgent = new http.Agent({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  keepAlive: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  keepAliveMsecs: 1000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  maxSockets: 128,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  maxFreeSockets: 32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  scheduling: 'lifo',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  timeout: 30_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const downstream = new Agent({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  keepAliveTimeout: 10_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  keepAliveMaxTimeout: 60_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  connections: 128,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pipelining: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>maxSockets</code></strong> 是单 origin 的最大并发连接数。默认值是 <code>Infinity</code>，这在实践中是危险的——一个流量突增会让进程打开上千个 socket，耗尽文件描述符（<code>ulimit -n</code> 通常 1024 或 4096）并让下游服务被打爆。取值应当由下游容量反推：如果下游单实例能处理 200 RPS、你的单请求耗时 50 毫秒，那么需要的并发数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200 \\times 0.05 = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>，乘以副本数与安全系数即可。<strong>128 是一个常见的起点</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong><code>maxFreeSockets</code></strong> 是空闲 socket 的保留上限。默认值 256。设得太小会让突发流量时无 socket 可用，需要重新握手；设得太大则让大量空闲连接占着下游的连接槽位与自身的内存。经验值是 <code>maxSockets</code> 的四分之一。</p>\n<p><strong><code>scheduling</code></strong> 决定从空闲池取 socket 的策略，<code>&#39;lifo&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;fifo&#39;</code>。<code>&#39;lifo&#39;</code>（后进先出）让最近被使用的 socket 优先复用，好处是空闲时间短的 socket 被优先使用，<strong>空闲超时的 socket 会自然淘汰</strong>——这对减少&quot;用了刚好被服务端关闭的连接&quot;很有价值。<code>&#39;fifo&#39;</code> 则均匀使用所有 socket。<strong>默认是 <code>&#39;lifo&#39;</code>，不要改</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong><code>timeout</code></strong> 是 socket 的空闲超时。必须设得<strong>小于</strong>下游服务的 keepalive 超时，否则你会从池中取到一个已被对端关闭的连接，然后经历一次 <code>ECONNRESET</code> 重试。常见的下游默认值：Nginx 是 75 秒、AWS ALB 是 60 秒、Go 的 <code>net/http</code> 是 90 秒。取 30 秒是安全的通用值。</p>\n<p>连接复用的收益可以用一个简化模型估算。设单次请求的业务处理时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{work}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，连接建立成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（TCP + TLS，跨机房通常 20–60 毫秒，同机房 1–3 毫秒），复用后摊销的连接成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{setup}/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{T} = t_{work} + \\frac{t_{setup}}{n} + t_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是排队时间，只在并发超过 <code>maxSockets</code> 时非零。这个式子说明两件事：复用把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 摊薄到可忽略，而 <code>maxSockets</code> 设小了会把节省下来的时间以排队的形式还回去。两者要一起调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"undici-与内置-fetch-的配置\">undici 与内置 fetch 的配置</h2><p>Node.js 18 起内置了 <code>fetch</code>，它的底层是 <code>undici</code>。用 <code>fetch</code> 时全局的 <code>http.Agent</code> 不生效，必须通过 <code>dispatcher</code> 配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { Agent, setGlobalDispatcher, request } from &#39;undici&#39;;&#10;&#10;setGlobalDispatcher(&#10;  new Agent({&#10;    connections: 128,&#10;    keepAliveTimeout: 10_000,&#10;    keepAliveMaxTimeout: 60_000,&#10;    headersTimeout: 30_000,&#10;    bodyTimeout: 30_000,&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;const res = await fetch(&#39;https://api.internal/orders&#39;, { method: &#39;GET&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Agent, setGlobalDispatcher, request } from 'undici';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setGlobalDispatcher(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  new Agent({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    connections: 128,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    keepAliveTimeout: 10_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    keepAliveMaxTimeout: 60_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    headersTimeout: 30_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bodyTimeout: 30_000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const res = await fetch('https://api.internal/orders', { method: 'GET' });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>setGlobalDispatcher</code> 是全局生效的便利方式，但它有一个重要的副作用：<strong>所有出站请求共享同一个连接池</strong>。这对不同下游混合的情况不理想——一个慢下游占满连接会影响其他下游。更好的做法是按下游分别建 <code>Pool</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { Pool } from &#39;undici&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const pools = {&#10;  orders: new Pool(&#39;https://orders.internal&#39;, { connections: 64, pipelining: 1 }),&#10;  catalog: new Pool(&#39;https://catalog.internal&#39;, { connections: 32, pipelining: 1 }),&#10;};&#10;&#10;export function ordersRequest(path, options = {}) {&#10;  return pools.orders.request({ path, ...options });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Pool } from 'undici';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const pools = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  orders: new Pool('https://orders.internal', { connections: 64, pipelining: 1 }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  catalog: new Pool('https://catalog.internal', { connections: 32, pipelining: 1 }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export function ordersRequest(path, options = {}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return pools.orders.request({ path, ...options });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按下游隔离池的好处有三个：故障隔离（一个下游的慢请求不会吃掉另一个的并发槽）、独立的参数调优（每个下游的容量不同）、以及可观测性（每个池的连接数、排队数可以单独上报）。代价是需要维护池的清单。</p>\n<p>关于 <code>pipelining</code>：它允许在同一个 TCP 连接上同时发出多个 HTTP/1.1 请求而不等响应返回（HTTP/1.1 流水线）。<strong>保持默认值 1</strong>。HTTP/1.1 的流水线在服务端支持不一致，而且存在队头阻塞——一个慢响应会阻塞后面所有响应。真正的多路复用要靠 HTTP/2；<code>undici</code> 的 <code>Client</code> 支持 HTTP/2，配置方式不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>客户端</th>\n<th>连接复用配置</th>\n<th>与 <code>fetch</code> 兼容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>http.Agent</code> / <code>https.Agent</code></td>\n<td>构造函数参数</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>undici.Agent</code></td>\n<td><code>setGlobalDispatcher</code> 或请求级 <code>dispatcher</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>undici.Pool</code></td>\n<td>按 origin 建池</td>\n<td>通过 <code>dispatcher</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>axios</code></td>\n<td><code>httpAgent</code> / <code>httpsAgent</code> 选项</td>\n<td>否（用 XHR 风格适配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>got</code></td>\n<td><code>agent</code> 选项</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若服务里混用了 <code>axios</code> 与 <code>fetch</code>，会存在两个独立连接池——这通常不是问题，但要意识到连接总数是两者之和，可能需要分别调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诊断连接复用是否生效\">诊断连接复用是否生效</h2><p>&quot;我配了 keepalive&quot;和&quot;keepalive 真的在工作&quot;是两件事。有四种验证方式。</p>\n<p><strong>最快的一种是看连接数。</strong> 用 <code>ss</code> 或 <code>netstat</code> 统计到目标下游的 ESTABLISHED 连接数：如果 QPS 是 200 而连接数稳定在 10 上下，复用生效；如果连接数随 QPS 波动且有大量 <code>TIME_WAIT</code>，说明每次都在新建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ss -tan state established dst 10.0.0.5:443 | wc -l&#10;ss -tan state time-wait dst 10.0.0.5:443 | wc -l\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -tan</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> established</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dst</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10.0.0.5:443</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -tan</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> time-wait</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dst</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10.0.0.5:443</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第二种是在应用内上报池状态。</strong> <code>http.Agent</code> 暴露了内部的计数器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { performance } from &#39;node:perf_hooks&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function reportAgentStats(agent, name) {&#10;  const sockets = Object.values(agent.sockets).reduce((n, list) =&gt; n + list.length, 0);&#10;  const free = Object.values(agent.freeSockets).reduce((n, list) =&gt; n + list.length, 0);&#10;  const queued = Object.values(agent.requests).reduce((n, list) =&gt; n + list.length, 0);&#10;  return { name, sockets, free, queued, at: performance.now() };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { performance } from 'node:perf_hooks';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export function reportAgentStats(agent, name) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const sockets = Object.values(agent.sockets).reduce((n, list) => n + list.length, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const free = Object.values(agent.freeSockets).reduce((n, list) => n + list.length, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const queued = Object.values(agent.requests).reduce((n, list) => n + list.length, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return { name, sockets, free, queued, at: performance.now() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>requests</code> 的累计长度是<strong>排队请求数</strong>——这个值长期大于 0 说明 <code>maxSockets</code> 设小了。<code>freeSockets</code> 长期为 0 说明 <code>maxFreeSockets</code> 设小了，或者下游在主动关连接。这两个信号分别指向两个不同的参数，是把参数调对的关键依据。</p>\n<p><strong>第三种是 <code>socket</code> 事件埋点。</strong> 监听 agent 上每个新 socket 的创建，统计连接建立频率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"agent.on(&#39;free&#39;, (socket, options) =&gt; {&#10;  metrics.increment(&#39;outbound.socket.freed&#39;, { host: options.host });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>agent.on('free', (socket, options) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  metrics.increment('outbound.socket.freed', { host: options.host });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更直接的方式是记录每次连接的建立耗时（<code>socket.on(&#39;connect&#39;)</code> 与 <code>socket.on(&#39;secureConnect&#39;)</code> 的时间差），如果这个耗时在延迟分布里占比可观，就说明复用不足。</p>\n<p><strong>第四种是看 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 的数量。</strong> 大量 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 意味着连接在被频繁关闭。注意 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 通常是<strong>主动关闭方</strong>产生的——如果你的服务是客户端并且大量出现 <code>TIME_WAIT</code>，那就是它主动断开了连接。</p>\n<p>连接建立成本本身也可以用 <a href=\"../diagnostics/clinicjs-profiling\">Clinic.js 的事件循环与 CPU 曲线</a> 侧面印证：如果 CPU 不高、延迟却随 QPS 线性上升，而 <code>ss</code> 显示连接数也在随 QPS 波动，那么瓶颈很可能就是每请求的握手开销，而不是业务逻辑。</p>\n<p>一个反直觉的常见问题：<strong>下游服务主动关闭空闲连接。</strong> 如果你的 <code>keepAliveMsecs</code> 或 agent 的 <code>timeout</code> 大于下游的 keepalive 超时，你会从池里取到一个已被对端关闭的 socket。Node.js 会在 <code>ECONNRESET</code> 时自动重试一次（对幂等的请求），表现为&quot;偶发延迟翻倍&quot;而不是错误。定位方法是把 agent 的 <code>timeout</code> 降到一个明显小于下游的值（比如 15 秒），看毛刺是否消失。</p>\n<p>对于使用 HTTP/2 或 gRPC 的场景还有一层额外考量：连接复用的粒度是&quot;流&quot;而不是&quot;请求&quot;，一个连接上可以并发多个流。这时 <code>maxSockets</code> 的概念不再适用，取而代之的是 <code>maxConcurrentStreams</code>。同时要注意 HTTP/2 的 <code>GOAWAY</code> 帧——服务端滚动重启时会主动通知客户端切换连接，客户端需要正确处理否则会出现请求失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Node.js 19 起 <code>http.globalAgent</code> 的 <code>keepAlive</code> 默认为 <code>true</code>（v22/v24/v26 均如此）；显式传 <code>agent: false</code> 会退回每请求新建连接。</li>\n<li>五个关键参数：<code>maxSockets</code>（按下游容量反推，128 是常见起点）、<code>maxFreeSockets</code>（约 <code>maxSockets</code> 的四分之一）、<code>scheduling</code>（保持 <code>&#39;lifo&#39;</code>）、<code>timeout</code>（必须小于下游 keepalive 超时，30 秒通用）、<code>keepAliveMsecs</code>。</li>\n<li>agent 的 <code>timeout</code> 大于下游 keepalive 超时会导致取到已关闭连接，表现为偶发延迟翻倍而非报错。</li>\n<li><code>fetch</code> 不走 <code>http.Agent</code>，需要 <code>undici</code> 的 <code>setGlobalDispatcher</code> 或请求级 <code>dispatcher</code>；按下游建 <code>Pool</code> 可获得故障隔离与独立调优。</li>\n<li><code>pipelining</code> 保持默认值 1——HTTP/1.1 流水线有队头阻塞，多路复用应换 HTTP/2。</li>\n<li>验证复用生效的四条路径：<code>ss</code> 看连接数与 <code>TIME_WAIT</code>、上报 <code>freeSockets</code>/<code>requests</code> 长度、socket 事件埋点、观察毛刺是否随 timeout 调整消失。</li>\n<li><code>requests</code> 长期非空 = <code>maxSockets</code> 太小；<code>freeSockets</code> 长期为空 = <code>maxFreeSockets</code> 太小或下游在关连接。</li>\n<li>下一步：连接复用把网络成本压下去后，CPU 上最显眼的一块通常是序列化——见 <a href=\"json-serialization-cost\">JSON 序列化成本与 Buffer 处理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HTTP Agent、keepalive 与连接复用","id":"http-agent-keepalive-与连接复用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"关键参数与取值依据","id":"关键参数与取值依据"},{"level":2,"text":"undici 与内置 fetch 的配置","id":"undici-与内置-fetch-的配置"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断连接复用是否生效","id":"诊断连接复用是否生效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"libuv 线程池：DNS 与文件系统阻塞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-performance-optimization/io-concurrency/libuv-threadpool"},"next":{"title":"JSON 序列化成本与 Buffer 处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-performance-optimization/services-memory/json-serialization-cost"}}